--##########| PEMs v2.1 |#########----
|Poetic Entropy Measures ANALYST
|Computes the entropy of humane text
|at two granularity levels:
|1> Visible Symbols (PSE)
|2> Word/Concept Level (PCE)
that actually describe the QUALITY
of INFORMATION in any text.
#####################################
Since v2, likewise computes+presents
the 2 PIMs: 
1> Symbolic Information Measure (SIM)
2> Conceptual Information Measure (CIM)
so-called Poetic Information Measures
that actually describe the QUANTITY
of INFORMATION in any text.
#####################################
|As per New Theory by Fut. Prof. JWL
#####################################

#0.0--[we'll need versioning]
V:vVER:{v2.1}

#0:---[store text]
V:vIN

####| COMPUTE PSE METRICS |####
#1:---[compute: S]
Y:vIN|d!:[\S]|v:|y!:
V:vS # total# [visible] symbols

#2:---[compute: ssS]
# basically computes symbol MSS
Y:vIN|d!:[\S]|U!:|v:vssS
Y!:vssS|V:vNssS ##symbolset symbols

#3:---[compute: PSE]
R@:{#vNssS#/#vS#}|R.:
V:vPSE # poetic symbol entropy

####| COMPUTE PCE METRICS |####
#4:---[compute: W]
Y:vIN|g!:,|r!:\w+:@|d!:@|v:|y!:
V:vW # total words

#2:---[compute: ssW]
#first, compute correctly:
# symbolset at word level
# more robustly than just u:|u.:
# basically computes word MSS
Y:vIN|G.:{ }|R!:\W+:{ }|U.:|v:vssW 
#then count those words...
g!:,|r!:\w+:@|d!:@|v:|y!:
V:vNssW ##symbolset words

#3:---[compute: PCE]
R@:{#vNssW#/#vW#}|R.:
V:vPCE # poetic concept entropy

#4:---[compute: SIM]
Z.:PLATFORM|F:WEB:lSIM_WEB:lSIM_CLI
L:lSIM_WEB # we'll use TEA+JavaScript
R@:{Math.log(#vNssS#) - Math.log(#vS#)}
V:vCMD
#evaluate using external powers...
Z*!:vCMD
V:vSIM #symbolic information quantity
J:lDONE_SIM # jump out..
L:lSIM_CLI # we'll use TEA+Python
R@:{python3 -c "import math; print(math.log(#vNssS#) - math.log(#vS#))"}
V:vCMD|Z*!:vCMD|V:vSIM
L:lDONE_SIM

#5:---[compute: CIM]
Z.:PLATFORM|F:WEB:lCIM_WEB:lCIM_CLI
L:lCIM_WEB
R@:{Math.log(#vNssW#) - Math.log(#vW#)}
V:vCMD|Z*!:vCMD|V:vCIM #store CIM
J:lDONE_CIM
L:lCIM_CLI # we'll use TEA+Python
R@:{python3 -c "import math; print(math.log(#vNssW#) - math.log(#vW#))"}
V:vCMD|Z*!:vCMD|V:vCIM
L:lDONE_CIM


####| REPORT PEMs RESULTS |####
R@:{PEMs ANALYST (#vVER#) REPORT:

----|BREAKDOWN|----
**INFORMATION QUALITY MEASURES**
Poetic Symbol Entropy
PSE: #vPSE#
---
Poetic Concept Entropy
PCE: #vPCE#

**INFORMATION QUANTITY MEASURES**
Symbolic Information Measure
SIM: #vSIM#
---
Conceptual Information Measure
CIM: #vCIM#

==BASED ON==
Unique Symbols (s-MSS): #vssS#
Unique Words (w-MSS): #vssW#
W[words]: #vW#
S[symbols]: #vS#

----|FOR TEXT|----
#vIN#
}
